              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "seg1983"
            },
            "reviewBody": "LOVE this recipe! I made them for Rosh Hashanah this year and they were such a big hit that I am making them again for holiday cookie exchanges. I am going to use cookie cutters this time to give them a fun holiday feel!",
